k2m5-family: licenses

This repository carries two licenses, by kind of file.

1. Code: MIT License (the text is below). This covers the programs and scripts: everything under search/ that we
   wrote, verification/*.py and verification/*.sh, tight_tile/*.py and tight_tile/*.sh, paper/figures/*.py, and the
   Lean sources under lean/.

2. Text and data: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode . This covers the paper and the reports (paper/*.tex,
   paper/*.pdf, tight_tile_report), the documentation (README.md files, docs/), and the data: certificate/,
   verification/boards, controls, logs and r9632 data, and the tight_tile outputs and cov.tar.xz. Please cite the
   paper and the archived release (see README.md) when you reuse them.

3. Third-party code: verification/verify.sh downloads, and the patches in search/ and verification/ apply to, code
   from evand/square-packing (Copyright (c) 2026 Evan Daniel, MIT License). That code is not part of this
   repository and stays under its own license.

